1
00:00:02,030 --> 00:00:06,030
The YCC program is so broad that there's something for everyone.

2
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:08,030
Everyone's starting from different places.

3
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:11,030
Some of us are runners. Some of us have never been hiking.

4
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:14,030
No matter your skill level, you're going to be welcomed.

5
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:20,370
It's really one of the best jobs around here.

6
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:24,370
A few weeks ago, we finished a really long section of boardwalk.

7
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:27,370
It was really an exciting time when we finished that,

8
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:29,370
because it was three years in the making.

9
00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:32,370
A lot of teamwork and cooperation. It was a good day.

10
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:35,370
By building these rock walls, we're protecting the trail

11
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:37,370
from those falling rocks, from that erosion.

12
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:40,370
And the rock walls last for decades, potentially.

13
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:45,370
It's really fulfilling to have tangible work that you can see

14
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:48,370
and have something to look back on that they're like,

15
00:00:48,370 --> 00:00:49,370
I did that.

16
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:53,370
They learn about a multifaceted job pool of the park.

17
00:00:53,370 --> 00:00:56,370
They allowed for us to get a lot of opportunity to talk

18
00:00:56,370 --> 00:01:00,370
with a actual field researcher who explained why we're doing this,

19
00:01:00,370 --> 00:01:03,370
how we're actually contributing to the scientific research

20
00:01:03,370 --> 00:01:04,370
that's being done.

21
00:01:04,370 --> 00:01:06,370
We need to make sure that we're listening to each other's concerns.

22
00:01:06,370 --> 00:01:08,370
We're looking out for each other.

23
00:01:08,370 --> 00:01:12,370
Even if it seems overlooked, making sure that the park is well maintained.

24
00:01:12,370 --> 00:01:14,370
So generations to come can visit this park

25
00:01:14,370 --> 00:01:18,370
and share the same wonder and excitement that each of us do.

26
00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:24,700
I try to cultivate a very fun environment,

27
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:27,700
because life doesn't have to be serious all of the time.

28
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:30,700
Recreation-wise, I would probably say whitewater rafting.

29
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:32,700
That whole day was very, very fun.

30
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:37,700
Sleeping under the stars and putting up bareboxes with my friends.

31
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:40,700
We did a Dragonfly larva collection day, and that was really fun.

32
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:44,700
All the staff, all the rangers that I met, just talking to them,

33
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:47,700
they had this really incredible sense of stewardship

34
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:50,700
and love for what they do and love for the land.

35
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:53,700
I started out with one of my friends,

36
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:55,700
and we didn't really talk to anybody else,

37
00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:58,700
but as the summer progressed, we were able to get closer with every person.

38
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:00,700
Everybody started talking more.

39
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:03,700
And at the end, it was like a miniature family.

40
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:08,700
I see the youth growing exponentially in ways

41
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:11,700
that they didn't even think that they were capable of.

42
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:15,700
We live here in the town where this fort stands.

43
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:19,700
My opinion has changed in the way that I care more about it.

44
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:22,700
In general, I've grown a lot just from being a YCC

45
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:24,700
and then being a park ranger this year

46
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:27,700
and also being a YCC just gets your foot in the door.

47
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:29,700
It doesn't really matter your background.

48
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:33,700
The skills that you gain from the Youth Conservation Corps

49
00:02:33,700 --> 00:02:35,700
translate in any job.

50
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:37,700
This is what I want to do with the rest of my life.

51
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:41,700
It's so rewarding and so amazing and incredible.

52
00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:47,700
Work, learn, play, and grow.

53
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:49,700
Join the YCC.

